xt-decoration:underline;text-underline:single;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2.3.4 详细设计</font></span></u></a></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span><a href=3D"#id-2.2.3Kimball数据仓库架构-3.数据开发和数据验证" ><u><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20text-decoration:underline;text-underline:single;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >3. 数据开发和数据验证</font></span></u></a></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span><a href=3D"#id-2.2.3Kimball数据仓库架构-4.需求交付" ><u><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20text-decoration:underline;text-underline:single;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >4.需求交付</font></span></u></a></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >1. Kimball数据仓库架构</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >1.1 简介</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;=20mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >特点</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >&#8204;：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(39,41,51);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >以维度建模（如星型模型）为核心，采用自下而上方式快速构建部门级</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >(比如电商行业的三级业务, 买家-&gt;用增-&gt;金币业务)数据集市，</font></span><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >优先满足业务用户的高效分析和查询需求</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(39,41,51);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >;</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;=20mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >架构</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >: </font></span><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >基于</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >Kimball 维度建模方法论&#8204;，强调自下而上设计, 以星型模型&#8204;或雪花模型&#8204;为核心构建</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;=20mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >&#8204;适用场景&#8204;：快速响应业务分析需求（如销售分析、用户行为分析), 比如互联网行业(电商、游戏)。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"16"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;mso-bidi-font-weight:normal;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >目前除了金融行业</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >, 大部分行业已经开始采用Kimball建模来建设数仓;</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >对比</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >lnmon数仓架构可以看到，Kimball与lnmon两种架构的主要区别在于核心数据仓库的设计和建立。Kimball的数据仓库包含高粒度的企业数据，使用多维模型设计，这也意味着数据仓库由星型模式的维度表和事实表构成。分析系统或报表工具可以直接访问多维数据仓库里的数据。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >在此架构中的数据集市也与</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >lnmon中的不同。这里的数据集市是一个逻辑概念，只是多维数据仓库中的主题域划分，并没有自己的物理存储，也可以说是虚拟的数据集市。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >Kimball数据仓库架构如图所示: </font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"282"  src=3D"~tmp{43d690fc-85cd-4e81-86f2-44023b071152}1576310.files/~tmp{43d690fc-85cd-4e81-86f2-44023b071152}15763101796.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >1.2 Kimball建模方式</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >1.2.1 概念</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >Kimball 模式从流程上看是自下向上的，是</font></span><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >指从最下游的业务数据分析需求开始，先想清楚要解决什么问题，解决这些问题需要知道哪些业务流程、索要分析的数据的维度和指标度量需求，再去上游数据源捞取需要的数据</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >。根据分析的领域不同，逐渐积累出一堆数据集市。这堆逐渐构建出来的数据集市就是逻辑上的数据仓库。即从数据集市</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >-&gt;数据仓库-&gt;数据源(先有数据集市再有数据仓库)的一种敏捷开发方法。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >1.2.2 流程</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >通常，</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >Kimball都是</font></span><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >以最终任务为导向</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >。首先，在得到数据后需要先做数据的探索，尝试将数据按照目标先拆分出不同的表需求。其次，在明确数据依赖后将各个任务再通过</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >ETL由Stage层转化到DM层。这里DM层数据则由若干个事实表和维度表组成。接着，在完成DM层的事实表维度表拆分后，数据集市一方面可以直接向BI环节输出数据了，另一方面可以先DW层输出数据，方便后续的多维分析。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >1.2.3 特点</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >Kimball支持数据仓库总线结构，提倡维度建模，以星型模型或是雪花模型等方式构建维度数据仓库。架构体系中，数据集市与维度数据仓库是紧密结合的，数据集市是数据仓库中一个逻辑上的主题域。各种前端工具将可以直接访问使用维度数据仓库。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face=3D"微软雅黑" >Kimball往往意味着快速交付、敏捷迭代，不会对数据仓库架构做过多复杂的设计，在变幻莫测的互联网行业，这种架构方式逐渐成为一种主流范式。下图就是Kimball建模的星型模型;</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"273"  src=3D"~tmp{43d690fc-85cd-4e81-86f2-44023b071152}1576310.files/~tmp{43d690fc-85cd-4e81-86f2-44023b071152}15763102686.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2. 企业实际案例</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >kimball建模是基于一个具体的需求出发的,我们看看一个具体的典型案例</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2.1 需求描述</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >电商</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >App中首页，Cart, Checkout ,购后pop弹窗，当前平台只可看到单个坑位的数据，无法追溯模板级别的数据，为了评估模板效率，需要提供pop数据看板，</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >需要三个监控看板，整体数据看板、场景看板、业务看板；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2.2 报表样式</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"16"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;=20mso-bidi-font-weight:normal;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >Overview 数据看板；</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"555"  src=3D"~tmp{43d690fc-85cd-4e81-86f2-44023b071152}1576310.files/~tmp{43d690fc-85cd-4e81-86f2-44023b071152}15763103144.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2.3 需求拆解</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2.3.1 业务需求</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;=20mso-bidi-font-weight:normal;font-size:10.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"16"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;=20mso-bidi-font-weight:normal;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >需求沟通</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >：与业务方进行需求细节沟通；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;=20mso-bidi-font-weight:normal;font-size:10.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"16"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;=20mso-bidi-font-weight:normal;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >需求类型</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >：数据分析</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >(60%)，用户标签(20%)，数据服务（10%），数据应用(10%)；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;=20mso-bidi-font-weight:normal;font-size:10.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"16"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;=20mso-bidi-font-weight:normal;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >参与人员</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >：业务方，技术，数据开发；</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >这里需要与业务方多轮沟通</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >(最多2轮)，明确需求细节、数据交付形式、期望交付节点；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"16"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;=20mso-bidi-font-weight:normal;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >主要目标</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >：明确业务需求，了解业务流程，确定数据分析目标。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >我会思考哪些内容，提问哪些问题：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >第一：先评估需求中的数据指标进行合理性评估（自己预先评估）；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >第二：提问需求问题：业务配置弹窗的流程（业务玩法，涉及的技术是谁）</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >第三：提问口径问题：评估数据口径（维度</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >+ 指标）准确性和合理性；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >第四：报表展示样式：前端样式有很多，哪些数据指标需要用卡片、表格</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >(趋势分析、交叉分析)、柱状图还是饼图，Top10排行。不同组件可能需要不同的应用层数据集；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >第五：输出一份标准数据</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >DRD(Data Requirement Documents): 数据需求整理成标准化的数据需求文档，主要是数据口径（数据维度取值： 计算ALL + 具体值 ），并且需要思考这些维度组合之后的取值合理性（原因：数据开发就是关联(Join)、过滤(where )、聚合(Count,SUM), 分组(Group by) ，而这些操作很大程度是通过这些操作拿到我们分析维度和数据）；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >最后但是比较重要的点：我们需要跟业务评估需求的优先级和</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >DDL ;</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2.3.2 数据</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >调研</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >主要目标：对现有数据情况梳理，梳理出现有数据详细情况以及需要补充的数据情况。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >根据第一阶段的数据需求文档，进行数据调研。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >第一：首先确认数据来源，数据上报方式，是有现成的数据中间层</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >(确认是否有 DWD层，DIM层，甚至DWS层数据)；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >第二：第一步如果有数据中间层，基本上我们会基于</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >Dwd层进行处理，如果没有，那么就需要看下这些数据源是否需要采集，还是已经有ods层数据；如果是数据采集，要确定已经有数据上报，并且需要验证数据；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >第三：无论是数据是来自</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >ods层还是数据采集数据，都需要进行数据调研，输出需求调研报告，这个很关键，决定这个需求此时要不要继续做的分水岭；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2.3.3 概要设计</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >主要目标：针对现有业务划分数据域和业务域，定义业务过程、定义总线矩阵；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >第一：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >确定业务域</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >UG，定义业务过程，弹窗曝光和点击，关闭三个行为</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >第二：定义总线矩阵，总线矩阵：（业务过程</font> <font face=3D"微软雅黑" >+ 一致性维度）</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><table class=3DMsoNormalTable  border=3D1  cellspacing=3D0  style=3D"border-collapse:collapse;margin-left:3.3000pt;border:none;=20mso-border-left-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;mso-border-top-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;=20mso-border-bottom-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;mso-border-insideh:0.7500pt outset windowtext;mso-border-insidev:0.7500pt outset windowtext;=20mso-padding-alt:0.7500pt 0.7500pt 0.7500pt 0.7500pt ;" ><tr><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.7500pt 3.7500pt 3.7500pt 3.7500pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-left-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;border-top:1.0000pt solid windowtext;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"page-break-after:avoid;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p></td><td valign=3Dcenter  style=3D"padding:3.7500pt 3.7500pt 3.7500pt 3.7500pt ;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;=20border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;border-top:1.0000pt solid windowtext;=20mso-border-top-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.7500pt solid windowtext;" ><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >用户</font></span><span style=3D"fo